  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tbolAIndia\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tA growing atlas of India’s spoken voices\n\t\n\nIndia does not speak in a single voice. It speaks through a vast and vibrant mosaic of languages, regional accents, dialects, and everyday expressions—across cities, towns, and rural communities.\nbolAIndia is a large-scale, expanding collection of Indian speech built to help speech AI hear that richness. It brings together conversational, read, educational, and broadcast audio, including code-switching and… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/kapturecx/bolAIndia.",
